      "short": "The proposed values make $\\tan2x$ undefined. Neither is valid; there are no solutions.",
      "worked": "The error is accepting the candidates without checking the original expression.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\times45^\\circ&=90^\\circ\\\\2\\times225^\\circ&=450^\\circ\\end{align*}$$\n\nBoth $\\tan90^\\circ$ and $\\tan450^\\circ$ are undefined. Therefore neither candidate satisfies the original equation, and there are no solutions.",
